    "long_instructions": "## Styling Your Website with AI\r\n\r\n**Your Task:** Before using AI to generate your stylesheet, write a detailed prompt that explains how your website should be styled. \r\n\r\nYour prompt must clearly answer:\r\n> 1. What is the goal?\r\n> 2. What are the constraints?\r\n> 3. What are the edge cases?",
