            "link": null,
            "locked": false,
            "fontSize": 36,
            "fontFamily": 1,
            "text": "Design a gardening app that displays a photo of each plant, \nits common name, a countdown timer for the next watering, \nand a \"Days until Harvest\" badge. \n\nUse a high-contrast theme with black text on a light cream \nbackground. Ensure all buttons are at least 60px tall for \neasy clicking with muddy hands. \n\nIf a plant is missing a photo or a schedule, the app should \ndisplay a generic \"seedling\" icon and a button that says \"Set \nSchedule Now\" instead of leaving a blank space.",
            "textAlign": "center",
            "verticalAlign": "middle",
            "containerId": "rn5vZF917P3dmt5USPQev",
            "originalText": "Design a gardening app that displays a photo of each plant, its common name, a countdown timer for the next watering, and a \"Days until Harvest\" badge. \n\nUse a high-contrast theme with black text on a light cream background. Ensure all buttons are at least 60px tall for easy clicking with muddy hands. \n\nIf a plant is missing a photo or a schedule, the app should display a generic \"seedling\" icon and a button that says \"Set Schedule Now\" instead of leaving a blank space.",
            "lineHeight": 1.25,
            "baseline": 482
          }
        ],
