    "teacher_markdown": "Have students read over their planning draft and try to clearly picture the fully styled website in their mind.\r\n\r\nIf their requirements are too vague for them to visualize the colors, fonts, and overall tone, encourage them to add at least one more specific detail to each section.\r\n\r\nThe clearer their styling requirements are, the more likely the generated stylesheet will match what they are intending to build."
  },
